  "profile_why_choose_us_title": "Why Choose Us",
  "profile_why_choose_us_content": "We connect chalet owners with guests looking for the perfect getaway. Our platform ensures transparency, security, and convenience for both parties. With verified listings and secure payment methods, you can book with confidence.",
